 | GET | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | |
 | PATCH | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | `{"title"?,"status"?,"assignee"?}` → 200 |
 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
+| PUT | `/projects/{pid}/members` | `{"roles":{"ben":"viewer",...}}` → 200 `[{"userId","role"}]` (all members, by user ID) |
+
+Bulk role change (`PUT .../members`): roles are `manager`, `contributor` or `viewer`.
+It is all-or-nothing: if any entry cannot be applied nothing changes. Only managers
+may call it (other readers 403, archived project 409). Every key must be an existing
+member and every role valid, and `roles` must not be empty (else 400). The project
+must keep at least one manager (else 409). A member who becomes a `viewer` is
+unassigned from the project's tasks.
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
